    <string name="donate_title">Support Kind Words</string>
    <string name="donate_text">Kind Words is free, has no ads and no tracking. If you like it, you can make a voluntary donation. It is not required, unlocks nothing and is handled by an external provider in your browser. The app itself sends no data.</string>
